OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly morning for many, with
OL,6,Fsome frost and isolated valley fog in
OL,7,Fprone spots. This will lead to a
OL,8,Fbright and sunny day with patchy
OL,9,Fafternoon cloud. The odd light shower
OL,10,Fis possible in the east later. Feeling
OL,11,Ffresh.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,14,Fthis evening, and briefly chilly.
OL,15,FHowever, cloud thickening from the
OL,16,Feast overnight with outbreaks of rain
OL,17,Farriving, some perhaps heavy.
OL,18,FTemperatures rising a little later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
