OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA cloudy start to Monday with
OL,6,Fsome rain, this clearing to the north
OL,7,Fand west through the morning. Sunny
OL,8,Fperiods developing in the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FUnsettled with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fdeveloping at times on Tuesday into
OL,14,FWednesday. Some brighter spells around
OL,15,Fon Thursday, though with showers too.
OL,16,FBecoming windy, with coastal gales
OL,17,Fpossible, especially later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
